<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>4.1.0</key>
	<dict>
		<key>Summary</key>
		<string>此版本新增每月提醒、更多匯出選項，以及帳戶、收款人和捷徑的新功能。</string>
		<key>Items</key>
		<array>
			<dict>
				<key>Title</key>
				<string>每月提醒</string>
				<key>Description</key>
				<string>自訂提醒現在可以在每月選定的日期或特定星期幾重複。</string>
				<key>IconName</key>
				<string>calendar.badge.clock</string>
				<key>IconColor</key>
				<string>#FF3D2F</string>
			</dict>
			<dict>
				<key>Title</key>
				<string>增強的 CSV 匯出</string>
				<key>Description</key>
				<string>CSV 匯出現在支援篩選，並可選擇一併匯出附件，還提供概覽，方便查看每筆交易對應的檔案。</string>
				<key>IconName</key>
				<string>arrow.up.doc</string>
				<key>IconColor</key>
				<string>#007AFF</string>
			</dict>
			<dict>
				<key>Title</key>
				<string>從淨資產中排除帳戶</string>
				<key>Description</key>
				<string>將指定帳戶從淨資產計算中排除。這些帳戶仍可正常用於交易。</string>
				<key>IconName</key>
				<string>chart.line.uptrend.xyaxis</string>
				<key>IconColor</key>
				<string>#35C759</string>
			</dict>
			<dict>
				<key>Title</key>
				<string>收款人標籤</string>
				<key>Description</key>
				<string>為收款人指定標籤，在交易中選擇該收款人時即可自動套用。</string>
				<key>IconName</key>
				<string>number</string>
				<key>IconColor</key>
				<string>#FF9500</string>
			</dict>
			<dict>
				<key>Title</key>
				<string>新的捷徑動作</string>
				<key>Description</key>
				<string>在 Apple 捷徑中，以列表形式取得現有的帳本、帳戶、類別、檔案夾、收款人和標籤。</string>
				<key>IconName</key>
				<string>bolt</string>
				<key>IconColor</key>
				<string>#5957D5</string>
			</dict>
		</array>
	</dict>
</dict>
</plist>
